This is my idea for an End Update.

First, some new block variants:
* Glowing obsidian. It cannot be pushed directly by pistons, but it can be moved using slime or honey blocks.
* [[Slab]]s, [[stairs]], and [[wall]]s for [[concrete]], [[glass]], all [[mineral blocks]], [[calcite]], [[netherrack]], [[endstone]], [[obsidian]]
** These can all be made in the [[stonecutter]].
* The [[saw]], which works like the stonecutter but for [[Planks|wood]].
* Walls for [[purpur]] and [[dark prismarine]].
* All brick blocks that could reasonably be chiseled or cracked.
* Slabs and stairs for [[dirt]], all of its variants, [[sand]], [[gravel]], [[concrete powder]], [[concrete powder]]

Void features:
* Voidite (block)
** Can be placed in the air like the [[floatato]].
** Found at the bottom of end islands.
* Voibucket (item)
** A [[bucket]] that cannot be filled and deletes liquids when used. Crafted from voidite.
** It is intended for bulk clearing of water and lava.
* Ghosting (status effect)
** Brewed from voidite.
** Makes the player immune to all splash and lingering potions and attacks, and void damage.
** Also prevents the player from being able to do melee attacks or shoot projectiles.
** Other damage like freezing and fire still effect the player.
** This effect also causes the player to lose air bubbles as if in [[water]].

